 re and who you would like to grow into being\, or just make something fun
  and pretty! We'll bring the art supplies and pizza so all you need to br
 ing is yourself.\n<div class="gmail_default">\n  <br />\n  Who: Everyone 
 is welcome!<br />\n  <br />\n  Where: Odell Residence Hall #003 (lower le
 vel)\n</div>
