X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<div class="gmail_default">\n  Join us for an hour wi
 th Professor Tung Yin\, who is giving a 1-CLE webinar on "Protecting Judi
 cial Independence From Populist Threats". The webinar is open to all memb
 ers of Lewis &amp\; Clark Law School's <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/gi
 ving/leadership-annual-giving-societies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
