SUMMARY:Salem Alumni Happy Hour!
DESCRIPTION:We are extending a special invite to our Salem alums. Whether
  you live or work in Salem\, we'll save you the trouble of driving to Por
 tland! Join alumnus Mike Drummonds '21 and Director of Alumni Relations\,
  Natasha Richmond '10\, for a casual happy hour! It's a great chance to r
 econnect\, hear the latest campus updates\, and enjoy a drink on a Wednes
 day evening.&#160\;When: Wednesday\, May 6th at 4:30 PM - 6:30 PM (PDT)  
   Where:Bentley's Bar &amp\; Grill (https://bentleysgrill.com/) (291 Libe
 rty St. SE\, Salem)    RSVP: Please RSVP HERE (https://engage.lclark.edu/
 register/?id=ad2ceac3-5132-4fd2-b964-6d44ee2fcc4b) so we know to expect y
 ou!    Bonus: We will be raffling off a new River Otter (https://college.
 lclark.edu/live/profiles/24414-river-otter) t-shirt to one lucky attendee
 !
