 hemistry\, and Physics will be on hand to celebrate with graduating senio
 rs and their families.</p><p>  The reception will be held from 10:00 am -
  11:30 am on graduation day\, in the Olin Lounge (located on the first le
 vel of Olin Science Center).</p><p>  Please let us know whether or not yo
 u will attend by completing the registration below\, or by emailing timmi
