SUMMARY:Dennis Dissertation Defense
DESCRIPTION:Kathryn Dennis\, a candidate in the Doctor of Education in Le
 adership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 10:00 AM on Friday\, M
 ay 11\, 2026 (location TBD).  Her dissertation is titled "The Multiracial
  Instructional Leader Style: A Heuristic Phenomenological Study Dissertat
 ion" and the chair of her committee is Dr. Mollie Galloway.  This event i
 s open to the public.  The presentation may be viewed via Zoom (https://l
 clark-edu.zoom.us/j/93907659183?pwd=PGRnHTdamMBFasbZMz4VeI4EgT2AVa.1).
