 issertation is titled "The Multiracial Instructional Leader Style: A Heur
 istic Phenomenological Study Dissertation" and the chair of her committee
  is Dr. <span style="font-family: 'Arial'\,sans-serif\;">Mollie Galloway<
 /span>.</p><p>  This event is open to the public.</p><p>  The presentatio
