BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T170000
LOCATION:Zoom
SUMMARY:Alumni Virtual Town Hall
DESCRIPTION:Hard to believe it's already been a year! Dean Alicia Ouellet
 te has hit the ground running\, and she's eager to connect with our alumn
 i community to share the law school's latest milestones\, future vision\,
  and – most importantly – hear directly from you.  Join us to hear ab
 out Dean Ouellette's strategic plan for the law school (https://www.lclar
 k.edu/about/strategic-plan/) as well as the school's progress. If you'd l
 ike to submit your question ahead of time to Dean Ouellette\, please fill
  out our form here (https://engage.lclark.edu/register/?id=65036112-45ef-
 4953-a9e5-9ce86dae51c8).&#160\;  You must register in advance in order to
  receive the Zoom link:RSVP here to receive Zoom information (https://lcl
 ark-edu.zoom.us/meeting/register/_FkNXQpzSrmrSVGj1Ar7LA).&#160\;  After r
 egistering\, you will receive a confirmation email containing information
  about joining the meeting.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Hard to believe it's already been a yea
 r! <strong>Dean Alicia Ouellette</strong> has hit the ground running\, an
 d she's eager to connect with our alumni community to share the law schoo
 l's latest milestones\, future vision\, and – most importantly – hear
  directly from <strong>you</strong>.</p><p>  Join us to hear about Dean O
 uellette's <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/about/strategic-plan/" target=
 "_blank" rel="noopener">strategic plan for the law school</a> as well as 
 the school's progress. If you'd like to submit your question ahead of tim
 e to Dean Ouellette\, please fill out our form <a href="https://engage.lc
 lark.edu/register/?id=65036112-45ef-4953-a9e5-9ce86dae51c8" target="_blan
 k" rel="noopener">here</a>.&#160\;</p><p>  You must register in advance i
 n order to receive the Zoom link:</p><p><strong><a href="https://lclark-e
 du.zoom.us/meeting/register/_FkNXQpzSrmrSVGj1Ar7LA" target="_blank" rel="
 noopener">RSVP here to receive Zoom information</a>.&#160\;</strong><br /
 ><br /></p><p>  After registering\, you will receive a confirmation email
  containing information about joining the meeting.</p>
