X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Lewis &amp\; Clark Law School will hold its in
 augural <strong>Beatrice M. Cannady Graduation Celebration</strong> on Fr
 iday\, May 15 at 10:00 AM in the Amphitheater with brunch provided. This 
 is an opportunity to celebrate graduating students and their accomplishme
 nts. Graduating students being recognized may bring up to four guests. <a
  href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSct4lLXwnv8ekHPaOvI9BeW1l
 kQgxX1NOCeEPeY2ZgSuwzq4w/viewform">RSVP here</a>\n</p>
