 hool\, Finn taught and developed undergraduate courses in Women\, Gender\
 , and Sexuality Studies at Oregon State\, focusing on queer and trans stu
 dies. He also publishes scholarship in Critical Race Theory\, Critical Le
 gal Studies\, and LGBTQIA+ STEM Studies. His doctoral research has examin
 ed anti-transgender legislation in the U.S. since 2016. Beyond research\,
  he has extensive experience as an activist\, lobbyist\, and community ed
 ucator in LGBTQIA+ and reproductive justice policy.</p><div id="lw_widget
 _470b39ba" class="lw_widget lw_widget_type_blurbs lw_widget_blurbs lw_wid
