 t: 1.5\;"><strong>Current GSEC Supervisors\, Faculty and Staff:</strong> 
 Free. Email <a href="mailto:cce@lclark.edu">cce@lclark.edu</a> to registe
 r.</p><p><strong><a class="btn-small-style-1" href="https://lclark.tfafor
 ms.net/wf1W4MQ?epid=a1aUY000002VSJp">Register Online</a></strong></p><div
  id="lw_widget_30f0017c" class="lw_widget lw_widget_type_blurbs lw_widget
