SUMMARY:Class Reunions - 2026
DESCRIPTION:It's time to step away from the billable hours and the briefs
 . The Lewis &amp\; Clark Law reunions are back\, and we're rolling out th
 e red carpet for the "6" years. If this is your class\, grab your classma
 tes and come and join us!        1966              1976              1986
               1996              2006              2016        Your classm
 ates are currently working on behind the scenes on a "Class Specific" act
 ivity – stay tuned for the RSVP link and the full itinerary.&#160\;Do y
 ou want to help plan? Email lawalum@lclark.edu (mailto:lawalum@lclark.edu
 ).  We look forward to seeing you!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  It's time to step away from the billabl
 e hours and the briefs. The Lewis &amp\; Clark Law reunions are back\, an
 d we're rolling out the red carpet for the <strong>"6" years</strong>. If
  this is your class\, grab your classmates and come and join us!</p><tabl
 e style="border-collapse: collapse\; width: 97.3466%\; border-color: #000
 000\; border-style: solid\;" border="2"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 13.7
 714%\;">        1966      </td><td style="width: 13.7714%\;">        1976
       </td><td style="width: 13.7714%\;">        1986      </td><td style
 ="width: 13.7714%\;">        1996      </td><td style="width: 13.7714%\;"
 >        2006      </td><td style="width: 13.7714%\;">        2016      <
 /td></tr></tbody></table><p class="">  Your classmates are currently work
 ing on behind the scenes on a "Class Specific" activity – stay tuned fo
 r the RSVP link and the full itinerary.&#160\;</p><p class=""><span style
 ="background-color: transparent\;">Do you want to help plan? Email <a hre
 f="mailto:lawalum@lclark.edu">lawalum@lclark.edu</a>.</span></p><p>  We l
 ook forward to seeing you!</p>
