 ate.rev.1738870822.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Class Reunion Save the Date
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Office of Law Alumni Relations<br />\n  <
 a href="mailto:lawalum@lclark.edu">lawalum@lclark.edu</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n  (
 503) 768-6890\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  We are officially celebrating all the <strong>
 Class Years ending in "6"</strong>! Whether you are the Class of '66 or '
 16\, it's time to reconnect\, reminisce\, and share your law school stori
 es!&#160\;<br />\n  <br />\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:law Alumni|law event|Law Reunion
END:VEVENT
